    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d681">

                <pb facs="0663" n="1397" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1397"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Terrell.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your 697 received. In the event of conflict at Zeitoun you should ask effective
                    protection of American property there, as well as for any American citizens
                    remaining. Renew efforts to keep open communication with citizens at Marash and
                    other exposed points.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
